  "Alpha infantry covenant_transmuter is the old Hunyuan model (no Tripo version exists) - the white cloaked blocks.",
  "Units have no weapons (DW-1024 attachments not built). Godot rim-light term not reproduced.",
  "B is a lighting/grade approximation; real Northgard needs hand-painted textures.",
  "Buildings sized as real buildings (longest side 12 m, command centres 16 m), units at Godot in-game heights.",
  "Editor close-camera shots and game shots were taken at different animation times."
 ]
